    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> backed <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/server/util/matcher/ServerWebExchangeMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.server.util.matcher\"><code>ServerWebExchangeMatcher</code></a>. Can work directly\nwith the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>, obtain an existing bean or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/AutowireCapableBeanFactory.html#createBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>create a new bean</code></a> that is\nautowired in the usual way.",
      "translation": "由 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 支持的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/server/util/matcher/ServerWebExchangeMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.server.util.matcher\"><code>ServerWebExchangeMatcher</code></a>`。可以直接与 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 配合使用，获取现有 Bean 或<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/AutowireCapableBeanFactory.html#createBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>创建新 Bean</code></a>，该 Bean 将以通常的方式进行自动装配。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> should be ignored and not used for\nmatching. If this method returns <code>true</code> then the context will not be used and\nthe <a href=\"#matches(org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange)\"><code>matches</code></a> method will return <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "如果返回 `<code>ApplicationContext</code>` 是否应被忽略且不应用于匹配，则此方法返回 `<code>true</code>` 时，将不使用该上下文，并且 `<a href=\"#matches(org.springframework.web.server.ServerWebExchange)\"><code>matches</code></a>` 方法将返回 `<code>false</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Called once the context has been initialized.",
      "translation": "在上下文初始化完成后调用一次。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Decides whether the rule implemented by the strategy matches the supplied exchange.",
      "translation": "决定策略实现的规则是否匹配提供的交易所。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-C\"><code>C</code> - the type of the context that the match method actually needs to use. Can be\nan <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> or a class of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>existing bean</code></a>.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-C\"><code>C</code> - 匹配方法实际需要使用的上下文类型。可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 或一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>现有 Bean</code></a> 的类。</span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - a supplier for the initialized context (may throw an exception)",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> - 初始化上下文的提供者（可能会抛出异常）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> should be ignored and not used for\nmatching.",
      "translation": "如果应忽略 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 且不用于匹配，则返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
